sequenceDiagram
    participant DAC as De-Identification Requester<br/>(DAC)
    participant MGR as De-ID Manager
    participant DI_P as De-Identifier<br/>(Preliminary clinical)
    participant DI_A as De-Identifier<br/>(Advanced clinical)
    participant DI_I as De-Identifier<br/>(Imaging measurement)

    Note over DAC,MGR: Permit and approved policies available<br/>R4 clinical set and R5 imaging measurement set
    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x1 Submit Job (R4 Job Task, async)
    Note over MGR: Validate authorization and both policies<br/>before accepting the job
    Note over DAC,MGR: If admission fails, return a synchronous error and stop
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted, Content-Location job-url

    Note over MGR: Compile one plan per assigned ruleSet<br/>and payload set
    MGR->>DI_P: ITI-x3 Submit Task (R4 Execution Task, preliminary clinical)
    Note over DI_P: Requested pseudonymization<br/>under the authorized linkage scope
    DI_P-->>MGR: 202 Accepted, Content-Location preliminary-url

    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted (in progress, Retry-After)

    MGR->>DI_P: ITI-x7 GET preliminary-url
    DI_P-->>MGR: 200 OK (preliminary output and evidence)
    Note over MGR: Validate preliminary output<br/>before advanced dispatch
    MGR->>DI_A: ITI-x3 Submit Task (R4 Execution Task, validated preliminary clinical input)
    Note over DI_A: Requested fixed generalization<br/>and record-level suppression
    DI_A-->>MGR: 202 Accepted, Content-Location advanced-url

    MGR->>DI_I: ITI-x3 Submit Task (R4 Execution Task, R5 measurement)
    Note over DI_I: Requested removal<br/>of the patient reference
    DI_I-->>MGR: 202 Accepted, Content-Location imaging-url

    MGR->>DI_A: ITI-x7 GET advanced-url
    DI_A-->>MGR: 200 OK (final clinical output and evidence)
    MGR->>DI_I: ITI-x7 GET imaging-url
    DI_I-->>MGR: 200 OK (final measurement and evidence)
    Note over MGR: Validate both sets and recheck authorization<br/>Record staged release Provenance for the clinical set
    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 200 OK (R4 Parameters with both sets and evidence)
    Note over DAC: Deliver both FHIR sets to the SPE<br/>(outside DIS)
